===Etymology 1===
From {{af|en|abate|-or|id2=agent noun|t1=to enter without right after the owner dies and before the heir takes over}}.<ref name=WID>{{R:MW3 1976}}</ref> From {{der|en|xno|-}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|law}} a person who, without right, enters into a [[freehold]] on the death of the last [[possessor]], before the heir or [[devisee]] {{defdate|Mid 16<sup>th</sup> century.}} <ref name=SOED>{{R:SOED5|page=2}}</ref>

