From {{af|en|abate|-or|id2=agent noun|t1=do away with}}.<ref name=WID/> From {{inh|en|enm|-}}, from {{der|en|fro|-}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|law}} one who abates, ends, or does away with a [[nuisance]] {{defdate|Late 16<sup>th</sup> century.}} <ref name=SOED/>

